  "notes": [
    "Suites overlap; do not add counts as unique tests.",
    "Broad regression preceded the final inspection/session and display-retirement fixes; its 15 old-assumption/test-double failures were updated and passed in final-regression.",
    "Compatibility had 925 passed and one four-frame overall-wait timeout; exact log investigation is recorded in the report. The functional budget was set to 60s, two repeats passed, and the simulated waiting marker was made once-per-instance. Final hardware suite passed 9.",
    "Real camera smoke and symlink capability were skipped, not passed. Physical takt, models, formulas, multi-hole protocol and field sync remain unverified."
